OL,3,GNEWSABorges and Me: New film tells
OL,4,Astory of writer's 1970s tour of
OL,5,AScotland
OL,6,
OL,7,FBooks and libraries occur throughout
OL,8,Fhis fiction, so it's no surprise that,
OL,9,Fon his trip to Scotland in 1971, he
OL,10,Fwanted to visit the historic Carnegie
OL,11,FLibrary in Dunfermline.
